    {
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 560,
        "height": 520,
        "content": "## Daily Log Digest Email\n\nCollects the last 24 hours of Administrate External Integration Log entries for one log origin and emails them as an HTML table.\n\n**How it starts:** this workflow has an *Execute Workflow* trigger. Call it from a scheduled workflow (for example a daily Schedule Trigger followed by an Execute Workflow node pointing here).\n\n**Config**\n\n- **LOG_ORIGIN_NAME** - text contained in the log origin's name (matched with `contains`)\n- **LOG_URL_TABLE_ID** - Data Table with columns `endpointName`, `url`; the row with `endpointName = automationLogs` holds the link to the logs page in Administrate\n- **RECIPIENTS_TABLE_ID** - Data Table with columns `description`, `emailValues`; the row whose `description` equals **RECIPIENT_GROUP** holds the recipient list\n- **EMAIL_WORKFLOW_ID** - id of your email-sending workflow. It receives `subject`, `recipients` and `bodyHTML`\n- **TIMEZONE** - IANA time zone used for timestamps in the email\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
